#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:273
msgid "📰 The next events announcement, if an administrator has switched it on, emails the coming events to everyone who joined it. The day before it goes out, each organizer gets a preview email with a button to stop it; the Crew app Admin tab has the same button. To add your own text to the next announcement, send /newsletter followed by the text in a private chat with the bot, or tell the bot there in your own words what to add (it shows the text with a Confirm button first), or use the Admin tab. Write it in Finnish or in English: it is translated into the other language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:277
#. translators: %d: the most events shown
msgid "📸 /events, in a private chat with the bot, shows you the next %d coming events as cards: the picture, the date, the price, a short description, and buttons to buy a ticket and to listen to the DJ. Tap Confirm and the bot posts the same cards in the group; tap Cancel and nothing is sent. You can also ask the bot in your own words which events come next."
msgstr ""

